abstract: >
  1,372,277 registered property sale transactions in Dubai, sourced from the
  Dubai Land Department (DLD) via the Dubai Pulse open-data platform, covering
  2004 through 5 October 2026. Published by dubairealestatedata.com, an
  independent analytics site built exclusively on official open data.
